//! `FixBadPixelsConstant`, `FixBadPixelsList`, `MapTable`, `MapPolynomial`, `GainMap`, `DeltaPerRow/Column`,
//! `ScalePerRow/Column`. `TrimBounds` and `WarpFisheye` are recorded but not applied.
